WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:06.500
At first the computer looked almost magical.
It recognized patterns in brain recordings with striking accuracy.

00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.500
But the researchers asked a tougher question:
could it recognize people it had never seen?

00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:20.500
One signal suddenly fell toward chance.
The machine had learned something about its subjects,

00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:27.500
not necessarily the mental state
the label promised.

00:00:27.500 --> 00:00:35.000
That is why we ask the same question when an audio product
promises to sharpen your mind:

00:00:35.000 --> 00:00:42.000
Where is the independent test of this exact product?
Learn the source. Then make your own decision.
